# T_SCRE: Items > Loans and holds, the open rows by due date with the
# overdue ones marked (TA_ALERT and '!'); Ctrl-PgDn through the views,
# the open loans, reservations and uses, the overdue rows (a late loan
# and a reservation due later is not among them), every row, and back; a
# loan shown, then edited (End, so the text typed goes after the old
# contact in place of replacing it) and saved.
S OPEN
K DOWN
S OPENSEL
K CPGDN
S LOANS
K CPGDN
S RESERVED
K CPGDN
S INUSE
K CPGDN
S OVERDUE
K CPGDN
S ALL
K CPGDN
S OPENBACK
K DOWN ENTER
S VIEW
K CTRL-E
S EDIT
K TAB END
T  (call first)
S EDITCON
K CTRL-S
S SAVED
K ESC
